      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Spellsinger.</strong> A caster presence from the Wood Elf Realms, built for brutal, legible table play. Its numbers are recalibrated from a PF2e-style creature benchmark and mapped back onto D&D challenge expectations.</p><p><strong>Rules Profile.</strong> AC 15; HP 114; proficiency +3; save DC 17. Linked armory entries: 16. Linked spell entries: 1.</p><blockquote><p>\"A warrior is measured when the line begins to break.\"<br><em>- Old World battlefield saying</em></p></blockquote>",
