        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Шторм стрел [Arrow Storm].</strong> Шторм стрел [Arrow Storm] tears shape from the Winds of Magic and forces it into a weaponized moment: bright, cold, hungry, or cruel according to the lore that birthed it.</p><p><strong>Mechanics.</strong> Casting uses action at range self spec. Targets make a Intelligence saving throw against the caster's spell save DC; on a failed save, apply its listed activity damage.</p><blockquote><p>\"Victory belongs to the hand that does not tremble at dusk.\"<br><em>- Old World magister</em></p></blockquote>",
